src/wombat/external/chessbench.py is a PyTorch port of the ChessBench 9M action-value
transformer and its tokenizer from google-deepmind/searchless_chess
(https://github.com/google-deepmind/searchless_chess), Copyright DeepMind Technologies
Limited, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The port changes the framework
(JAX to PyTorch) and the interface.

Third-party software, data and tools used by Wombat, with their licenses, are listed in
THIRD_PARTY.md. None of them is copied into this repository apart from the port above.
